// Tests for RefCell::try_borrow, RefCell::try_borrow_mut
// BLOCKED: nullable-ptr optimization codegen bug
// The compiler generates `icmp eq ptr %t5, null` but Maybe[Ref[T]] is a struct
// `{ i32, i64 }`, not a pointer. The nullable-ptr optimization incorrectly assumes
// Maybe wrapping a ref type can be represented as a nullable pointer.
//
// Error: '%t5' defined with type '%struct.Maybe__Ref__I32 = type { i32, i64 }'
//        but expected 'ptr'
//
// Both try_borrow and try_borrow_mut are blocked by this same issue.
// Tests below will pass once the codegen bug is fixed.
use test::{assert, assert_eq}
use core::cell::ref_cell::RefCell

